1c:["$","p","1",{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700","children":"Start by checking whether the store has an active sitewide code, since these tend to apply to the widest range of products. From there, look for category-specific codes that might stack with ongoing sales."}]
1d:["$","p","2",{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700","children":"Always add items to your cart before applying a code. Some codes are excluded from clearance or bundle pricing, so it helps to see the discount reflected in your cart total before you complete checkout."}]
1e:["$","p","3",{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700","children":"Finally, pay attention to expiration dates. A directory that clearly marks active versus expired coupons will save you from the frustration of copying a code that no longer works."}]
